---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SocialIcon from '../components/SocialIcon.astro';
import Subscribe from '../components/Subscribe.astro';
import { SITE, SOCIALS } from '../config';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Onkar Sawarna, software engineer at Acceldata. Previously Menlo Security. Writing on observability, networking, and distributed systems."
  image="/og/about.png"
>
  <section class="about">
    <header class="about-intro">
      <div class="portrait-wrap">
        <img
          class="portrait"
          src="/onkar.jpg"
          alt="Onkar Sawarna"
          width="220"
          height="220"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="about-heading">
        <h1>Hey, I am {SITE.author.split(' ')[0]}.</h1>
        <p class="lede">engineering, networking, observability, and distributed systems.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="about-body">
      <p>
        I am a software engineer at Acceldata. I work on observability: how you
        see a distributed system while it is running, and how you find out what
        broke before the user has to tell you.
      </p>
      <p>
        Before this I spent four years at Menlo Security. I joined as an intern and
        left as a Senior Engineer, working on cybersecurity and networking. That
        stretch taught me how production systems actually behave: latency, failure,
        and the parts of a network you only notice when they are wrong. Most of
        what I know I learned inside one codebase, slowly.
      </p>
      <p>
        I studied Mathematics and Computing at BIT Mesra. Alongside the job I have
        gone deep on DSA and system design. Hundreds of problems. The useful part
        was not the problem numbers. It was getting faster at seeing the pattern,
        and getting clearer at explaining the tradeoff.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is where I write that down. Notes on systems and networking.
        Mental models from problem-solving, not solution dumps. The occasional
        piece on the non-technical parts of the job: the transitions, the
        assumptions that only show up when you change teams. Written while the
        details are still sharp.
      </p>
      <p>
        If something here is useful, wrong, or worth arguing about, write to me.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-subscribe">
      <Subscribe />
    </div>

    <ul class="elsewhere" aria-label="Find me elsewhere">
      <li>
        <a href={SITE.resume} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Resume</a>
      </li>
      {SOCIALS.map((social) => (
        <li>
          <a href={social.href} target="_blank" rel="me noopener noreferrer">
            <SocialIcon name={social.label} />
            {social.label}
          </a>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 46rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4.5rem var(--gutter) 5rem;
  }
  .about-intro {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .portrait-wrap {
    width: 11rem;
    height: 11rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    background: #899b98;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(22, 22, 22, 0.08);
  }
  .portrait {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 48% 6%;
    transform: scale(1.45) translateY(8%);
    transform-origin: 50% 12%;
  }
  .about h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5.5vw, 3.15rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 0.55rem;
  }
  .lede {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.4vw, 1.45rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--accent-mid);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 28ch;
  }
  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .about {
      padding: 2.25rem var(--gutter) 3.5rem;
    }
    .about-intro {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1.15rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .portrait-wrap {
      width: 8.5rem;
      height: 8.5rem;
    }
    .lede { max-width: none; }
    .elsewhere {
      gap: 0.6rem;
      margin-top: 2.25rem;
    }
    .elsewhere a {
      padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
      min-height: 2.75rem;
    }
  }
  .about-body p {
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    margin: 1.15em 0;
  }

  .about-subscribe {
    margin-top: 2.75rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .elsewhere {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    padding-top: 0;
  }
  .elsewhere a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--paper-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem;
    transition: color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .elsewhere a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
